# Written by Next itself on every dev run and every build, in each Next app,
# and rewritten without asking. Ignored rather than tracked, which is the
# convention Next's own create-next-app ships and which this repository
# already half-followed: eslint.config.mjs has ignored it since the
# applications existed, so tracking it would have meant a file that is
# generated, linted by nothing, and appears as a change after every run.
#
# The symptom that prompted the decision was three of them turning up as
# untracked noise in a worktree during a feature, repeatedly.
next-env.d.ts

